ldk-controller (0.7.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Pin ICU4X crates to 2.1.x for Rust 1.85 compat (trixie)
  * Bump nostr-sdk for WebSocket PING/PONG keepalive fix
  * Add tracing-subscriber for runtime observability (RUST_LOG)
  * Fix stale NWC request processing on startup (since=now filter)
  * Implement d-lf fork improvements (#99 items 1-5, 13)
  * Move fee estimation from NNC to NWC
  * Add NWC compliance: list_invoices, list_offers, list_addresses, disable_offer
  * Remove _msat suffix from NNC fields (align with NIP-47 convention)

 -- René Malmgren <rene@flowrate.dev>  Thu, 17 Apr 2026 00:19:00 +0400

